      </nav>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav" aria-label="Open menu">
        <span class="nav-toggle__bar"></span>
        <span class="nav-toggle__bar"></span>
        <span class="nav-toggle__bar"></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
      <div class="page-hero__media">
        <img src="assets/property/sunset-1.jpg" alt="Sunset over Narragansett Bay near Weathervane Cottages" width="1920" height="900" fetchpriority="high">
        <div class="page-hero__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero__content container">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Aquidneck Island</p>
        <h1 id="page-heading" class="text-on-dark">The area around <em>us</em></h1>
        <p class="page-hero__lede text-on-dark">West-side sunsets, harbor towns, and the easy rhythm of Rhode Island — 4.5 miles from Newport, 7 miles from Bristol.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OVERVIEW -->
    <section class="split section" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
      <div class="container split__grid">
        <div class="split__media reveal">
          <img src="assets/property/aerial-1.jpg" alt="Aerial view of Weathervane Cottages and surrounding Aquidneck Island landscape" width="900" height="700" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="split__content reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Where We Are</p>
          <h2 id="overview-heading">Portsmouth, on the quiet side of the <em>island</em></h2>
          <p>Weathervane sits at 1172 West Main Road on the west side of Aquidneck Island, with evening light over Narragansett Bay and small-town Rhode Island at the doorstep.</p>
          <p>You’re close enough to Newport’s harbor energy and Bristol’s historic charm for an easy outing — and far enough to come home to fire pits, gardens, and unplugged calm.</p>
          <ul class="icon-list">
            <li>
              <svg class="icon-map-pin" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-5.5 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 6.5 7 12 7 12z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
              1172 West Main Road, Portsmouth, RI 02871
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="icon-sun" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M12 3v2.5M12 18.5V21M3 12h2.5M18.5 12H21M5.6 5.6l1.8 1.8M16.6 16.6l1.8 1.8M18.4 5.6l-1.8 1.8M7.4 16.6l-1.8 1.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              Sunset views toward Narragansett Bay
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MAP -->
    <section class="map-section section section--cream" aria-labelledby="map-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Find Us</p>
          <h2 id="map-heading">On the map</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="map-section__frame reveal">
          <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2984.1739767784466!2d-71.27101332336436!3d41.58711887127528!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x89e5ab41a1decd6b%3A0x6e12cf2ef737461d!2sWeathervane%20Cottages!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1730824008094!5m2!1sen!2sus" width="100%" height="450" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" title="Map showing Weathervane Cottages at 1172 West Main Road, Portsmouth, Rhode Island"></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="map-section__caption reveal">
          <p>
            <strong>Weathervane Cottages</strong> · 1172 West Main Road, Portsmouth, RI 02871 ·
            <a href="tel:+14013668010">(401) 366-8010</a>
          </p>
          <p class="map-section__drive">4.5 miles from Newport · 7 miles from Bristol</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 9 ATTRACTION CARDS -->
    <section class="attractions section" aria-labelledby="attractions-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Nearby</p>
          <h2 id="attractions-heading">Favorite ways to spend a <em>day</em></h2>
          <p class="section-header__lede">A handful of the places and pleasures within easy reach of the property — ask us for personal tips when you book.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-grid card-grid--3">
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/sunset-2.jpg" alt="Evening light over the water" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Narragansett Bay</h3>
              <p>West-facing water light and sea air — the backdrop to every Weathervane evening.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/aerial-2.jpg" alt="Aerial landscape of the island area" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Newport Harbor</h3>
              <p>Just 4.5 miles south — sailing culture, waterfront walks, and storied streets.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/garden-2.jpg" alt="Lush garden greenery" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Cliff Walk</h3>
              <p>Newport’s iconic shore path — mansions on one side, open Atlantic on the other.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/grounds-2.jpg" alt="Open grounds and trees" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Ocean Drive</h3>
              <p>A classic Newport loop of coastline, estates, and pull-over views.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/garden-1.jpg" alt="Garden path at Weathervane" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Bristol Waterfront</h3>
              <p>Seven miles north — historic downtown, harbor strolls, and small-town ease.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/lifestyle/fire-pit-4.jpg" alt="Warm evening atmosphere" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Local Dining</h3>
              <p>From clam shacks to harbor tables — we’ll point you toward our family favorites.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/sunset-3.jpg" alt="Sunset sky over the property" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Sailing &amp; Boating</h3>
              <p>Charters, moorings, and the deep sailing heritage that defines this coastline.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/grounds-3.jpg" alt="Property grounds in daylight" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Beaches</h3>
              <p>Island and mainland shores within a short drive — pack a towel and go.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card card--flat reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/sign.jpg" alt="Weathervane Cottages sign" width="700" height="460" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Portsmouth Itself</h3>
              <p>Farms, quiet roads, and the unhurried pace that makes coming “home” to Weathervane so sweet.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 DAY TRIPS -->
    <section class="day-trips section section--cream" aria-labelledby="day-trips-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Farther Afield</p>
          <h2 id="day-trips-heading">Easy day trips</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
          <article class="card reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/aerial-1.jpg" alt="Aerial view suggesting coastal Rhode Island" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Newport</h3>
              <p>4.5 miles — mansions, the Cliff Walk, harbor life, and more good dinners than you can fit in one stay.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/garden-2.jpg" alt="Lush greenery reminiscent of coastal New England towns" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Bristol</h3>
              <p>7 miles — a historic waterfront town famous for its Fourth of July celebration and walkable downtown.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/sunset-4.jpg" alt="Blue-hour coastal light" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Jamestown</h3>
              <p>A short hop across the bay — quieter shoreline energy, local spots, and wide water views.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card reveal">
            <div class="card__media">
              <img src="assets/property/evening-1.jpg" alt="Evening property atmosphere" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <h3 class="card__title">Providence</h3>
              <p>The capital within reach for a culture day — then back to Portsmouth before the fire pits light.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta section section--navy" aria-labelledby="final-cta-heading">
      <div class="container container--narrow final-cta__inner reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Make It Home Base</p>
        <h2 id="final-cta-heading" class="text-on-dark">Island days. <em>Weathervane</em> nights.</h2>
        <p class="text-on-dark">Book direct and we’ll share the tips we give our own friends — the tables, the walks, the timing.</p>
        <div class="final-cta__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="book.html">Book Your Stay</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="tel:+14013668010">(401) 366-8010</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

